{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は名古屋の全国握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15th全握は2回目なので\nセトリは省略しちゃいますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の\n『命の真実 ミュージカル「林檎売りとカメムシ」』の相手役は\nちーちゃんがやってました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/18/9824034/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未、ちーちゃん ときたので\n次は誰か楽しみだね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手の方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/18/9824034/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織と一緒のレーンでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/18/9824034/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田的に伊織は\n2期生の中で唯一、塩対応してるけど\n結構、仲良しな方だと思うよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな伊織と一緒のレーンだったので\n始まる前とかはたくさん話してましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/18/9824034/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何話してたかは内緒ね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、みんな体調を心配してくれたけど\nもう元気だよー！\nありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足元の悪い中、\n来てくださってありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/18/9824034/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の乃木中は\nメンバーたくさん出てるよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田も収録には参加したので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーに来てくださったかたは特に\n観てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/18/9824034/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}